## Key Concepts
- Online ICA vs offline
- Whitening with forgetting factor
- Per-bin ICA vs joint diagonalization
- Permutation alignment across bands
- Dropout robustness and adaptation
- Evaluation: SDR/SIR and listening tests

## Code Example
```javascript
// Outline of online whitening with forgetting factor
let W = eye(N);
const forget = 0.98;
for (frame of frames){
  let x = frame; // N channels
  // centering
  x = x - mean(x);
  // whitening with exponential forgetting
  let xWhiten = W.transpose() * x;
  W = forget * W + (1-forget) * (x * x.transpose());
  // Demixer would go here
}
```

